            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Thomas, justice Thomas: \u201cNeither of the two schools you talk about has indicated that it will accept students who receive state funding or subsidies?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfbb69b749e96a95db53be42b06f406dc63450fbd0dae4f9ede9c7f4c04b5512",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfbb69b749e9-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 9,
              "start": 9
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Barrett, justice Barrett: \u201cWell, would the Nelsons go to any place besides Temple Academy?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfbb69b749e96a95db53be42b06f406dc63450fbd0dae4f9ede9c7f4c04b5512",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfbb69b749e9-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan: \u201cCan I take you back to Justice Breyer\u2019s point and also the Chief Justice\u2019s hypothetical, is you said, well, there\u2019s this, you know, strange use\u2011status?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfbb69b749e96a95db53be42b06f406dc63450fbd0dae4f9ede9c7f4c04b5512",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfbb69b749e9-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, justice Gorsuch: \u201cCounsel, on that, I believe the government\u2019s response \u2026 is that there is no choice \u2026 because individuals can still educate their children in religion by sending them to after\u2011school programs.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfbb69b749e96a95db53be42b06f406dc63450fbd0dae4f9ede9c7f4c04b5512",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfbb69b749e9-0004-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 94,
              "start": 94
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Thomas, justice Thomas: \u201cWhat exactly is an anti\u2011establishment interest and where does it come from?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfbb69b749e96a95db53be42b06f406dc63450fbd0dae4f9ede9c7f4c04b5512",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfbb69b749e9-0004-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 107,
              "start": 107
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, justice Gorsuch: \u201cI didn\u2019t see in the government\u2019s brief any strict reliance \u2026 on a status\u2011use distinction. Rather, I saw this analogy to government speech. Is that right?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfbb69b749e96a95db53be42b06f406dc63450fbd0dae4f9ede9c7f4c04b5512",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfbb69b749e9-0005-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 119,
              "start": 119
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, justice Gorsuch: \u201cIncluding on the basis of sex and race and other personal characteristics like that?\u201d"
      }
    ],
